# Simulator Testing

To run the iOS app in a simulator, follow the `simulator-testing` skill.
For real data, recover from a key in the gitignored `RecoveryKeys.md`.
For a new library, bootstrap against a throwaway stack. Both need a
fresh install, so uninstall the app first. Never echo a recovery link,
password, or join payload anywhere.
